\]

Integrating both sides with respect to \( t \):

\[
v_c(t) = \frac{a}{R} t + C
\]

At \( t = 0 \), \( v_c(0) = v_0 \), so:

\[
v_0 = \frac{a}{R} \cdot 0 + C \implies C = v_0
\]

