In $\triangle BCD$, by the cosine law:
\[ BD^2 = BC^2 + CD^2 - 2 \cdot BC \cdot CD \cos \theta \]
\[ BD^2 = b^2 + a^2 - 2ab \cos \theta \]

Since $\alpha > \theta$, we have $\cos \alpha < \cos \theta$.

