Energy_TNT = mass_TNT * energy_per_gram
8.57 * 10^6 J = mass_TNT * 4680 J/g

Now, we can solve for the mass of TNT:

mass_TNT = (8.57 * 10^6 J) / (4680 J/g)
mass_TNT ≈ 1831 g

